    "description": "<p dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">The sweet aroma and flavor of Red Ape cassia cinnamon is a real treat is this spiced Applesauce. Tame even the unruliest break- fast or feast with this wonderful treat. Cassia cinnamon is a special variety of cinnamon that partakes a sweet flavor into any dish. Other cinnamon can be bitter or dry tasting. Not Cassia cinnamon it is light, u y and full of that sweet cinnamon flavor that we all crave. Enjoy!</span></p><p><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">Ingredients: Organic Apples, Organic Cinnamon</span></p>",
